#: scenario7:scenario7_9ED0C5D0_A167_4441_98DD_EA5BCB38F709
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4bf472fd9ee35b2ecbcc59a785908467920b22112b6dafebbccd5cd81f77af78
#. default-sha256: 64a91be35848f589d14d388dd798cbf66d166d926fbad468ef9f0cb1c68b8631
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9ED0C5D0_A167_4441_98DD_EA5BCB38F709"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I received no visitors except the servants—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫and "
"again, none of them would look me in the eye."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ad eccezione dei domestici, non ricevevo alcuna visita—⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫e anche allora, nessuno di loro mi guardava negli occhi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E4DB4FB6_DCE0_4EA0_B57D_1EBFF29EA58C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec8c44455c82659ffd339dfa478d51cd02afda6a604fb729d514b75f42b04ac2
#. default-sha256: a1dd3d5a4550b0786f375edb2c509661ee2d96347e32784a0f94cfbd8a4f8b0d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E4DB4FB6_DCE0_4EA0_B57D_1EBFF29EA58C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Every day was the same. Day in and day out, day in and day out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ogni giorno era uguale all’altro. Giorno dopo giorno."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D05F1820_1BCD_41A9_BD3C_D2C42C2E9919
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a1299933e98fa7a18b025e390e2422d2cacce973f6053c1531a96835893952a
#. default-sha256: 674accba228c122cc48bd4a55f566b092aee5d414f5b6dde2e992d7a767c9f36
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D05F1820_1BCD_41A9_BD3C_D2C42C2E9919"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was my mother’s handwriting on the parchment.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We lived in the same house, yet "
"she refused to show herself before me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sulla pergamena c’era la calligrafia di mia madre.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Abitavamo nella stessa casa, "
"eppure si rifiutava di mostrarsi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_70B207E1_B667_4518_A876_7A31707D2637
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c23a2c6f12844145a227ae8ce6cef5b9ae53a382021da7dfdb3c907be14b7ca7
#. default-sha256: 247729e5abaf8ea82048fe1d79686eec60867c53a1c7706c51c1232495045bec
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_70B207E1_B667_4518_A876_7A31707D2637"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had no choice but to respond to her letters."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non avevo altra scelta che rispondere alle sue lettere."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E8081A6E_6877_4A07_984A_116A51D87A8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a3390af57b0e5010da5502c40bac1db95b53e7af1e15e417df0f377ac412c7e
#. default-sha256: 53d729e8d4011cc08bf31d8d21d0a71e7951a85f0b33fd7e1ca60e1ea12aa9b2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E8081A6E_6877_4A07_984A_116A51D87A8F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a constant sense of urgency to her letters—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like she might fall apart "
"completely at any second."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’era un costante senso di urgenza nelle sue lettere—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫come se fosse potuta crollare "
"definitivamente da un momento all’altro."

#: scenario7:scenario7_02554262_3CA2_40FB_B05E_478FCA02B718
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd900d4f7fd68b57ae13929ec141566610bdda46c700da8071570bc5a11ead50
#. default-sha256: b6d16794b2140590b39dc2e352090a0b8a02018c6252ef5d0ff4e020b817b22b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_02554262_3CA2_40FB_B05E_478FCA02B718"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On paper, she expressed her concern for me, but that concern only served to cause me more "
"pain,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sulla carta, esprimeva la sua preoccupazione per me, ma quella sua preoccupazione serviva "
"solo a procurarmi altro dolore,"

